  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Large blister packs sold from November 2007 at stores such as Target and Wal-Mart, each with two cosmos holofoil promos, four Diamond & Pearl Series booster packs and an Energy coin. In North America a blue pack held Buizel DP13 with POP Series 6 Gible, and a red pack Chatot DP14 with POP Series 6 Pikachu; elsewhere a yellow pack held the same pair as the red, and a green pack Shinx DP15 with Pikachu DP16. The foil Gible and Pikachu aren't found in POP Series 6 packs, which held only non-holo copies of the set's rares. Buizel, Chatot and Shinx use art first printed in Japan on Meiji's February 2007 chocolate promos.",
